{"reviewId": "21221247_80SSieqrV", "review": {"abstract": "全球黄金-原油价格比率", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "黄金-原油价格比率(金油比)是国际金融市场中反映黄金与原油相对价值的重要指标，通常以每盎司黄金价格除以每桶原油价格计算。这一比率不仅揭示了两种商品的供需动态，还常被视为全球经济健康的晴雨表。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "8998-9009", "createTime": 1749837798, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "21221247_80SSieqrV", "userVid": 21221247, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 6, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 21221247, "name": "lll", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/UIG6ibh0IfaBW1QjDIfUKibsJyLBoqec6nYwqlLvko118IMFcW4BS5kMp8Z8EZJ5V7zlBAFHO1xH6qEH1Orm1UcA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "lll", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "LLL", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-500", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 500}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 11, "likes": [{"userVid": 414458585, "name": "🌲", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0002-qHEk9NbwnipEQVkzI37JJ10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-100", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 100}}], "commentsCount": 4, "hotComments": [{"content": "资产配置参考\n高金油比可能预示黄金相对高估或原油低估。历史上，比率向均值回归时，通常由原油价格反弹主导(如2008年后油价回升)，而非黄金下跌。投资者可结合其他指标(如美元指数、通胀预期)调整组合，例如在高比率时增持原油或能源股，减持黄金。", "reviewId": "21221247_80SSieqrV", "commentId": "21221247_80SSieqrV_c21221247_80STaxKE2", "userVid": 21221247, "createTime": 1749838601, "likesCount": 7, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 21221247, "name": "lll", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/UIG6ibh0IfaBW1QjDIfUKibsJyLBoqec6nYwqlLvko118IMFcW4BS5kMp8Z8EZJ5V7zlBAFHO1xH6qEH1Orm1UcA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "lll", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "LLL", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-500", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 500}}}, {"content": "蹭个热点，中东伊朗以色列冲突，\n\n截至2025年6月14日，纽约黄金期货价格为3,452.7美元/盎司，布伦特原油期货价格为62.96美元/桶，按此计算的金油比约为54.84;若以WTI原油期货价格64.98美元/桶计算，比率约为53.13。这一数值显著高于历史均值(10-25)，接近2024年6月创下的30.8高位，反映出当前市场对经济不确定性的担忧和避险需求的激增", "reviewId": "21221247_80SSieqrV", "commentId": "21221247_80SSieqrV_c21221247_80SSZtH0p", "userVid": 21221247, "createTime": 1749838437, "likesCount": 5, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 21221247, "name": "lll", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/UIG6ibh0IfaBW1QjDIfUKibsJyLBoqec6nYwqlLvko118IMFcW4BS5kMp8Z8EZJ5V7zlBAFHO1xH6qEH1Orm1UcA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "lll", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "LLL", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-500", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 500}}}], "comments": [{"content": "目前的金油比 77.6 是一个非常极端的信号，表明市场目前极度缺乏安全感，资金正在拼命从风险资产（原油）撤出，涌向避险资产（黄金）。", "reviewId": "21221247_80SSieqrV", "commentId": "21221247_80SSieqrV_c327819840_86ijC0tIB", "userVid": 327819840, "createTime": 1768890905, "author": {"userVid": 327819840, "name": "哄哄 ", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/ajNVdqHZLLACtSrAQtXthQcibQxarFUVWibwWTvywggNnYCbCDpMCiccCqFjYetX0szuj3ApdQK8HqticpicHoLhoicQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-1-0", "desc": "21天阅读挑战", "title": "21天阅读挑战", "levelIndex": 0}}}, {"content": "黄金已经涨疯了，但是石油还被各种因素压制，空黄金多能源！", "reviewId": "21221247_80SSieqrV", "commentId": "21221247_80SSieqrV_c926822211_85oEkA1lo", "userVid": 926822211, "createTime": 1765729073, "author": {"userVid": 926822211, "name": "小冯", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0016-~7hbGDcVwP7OhLPZFdBZK10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "俯仰之间，已为陈迹", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}}, {"content": "资产配置参考\n高金油比可能预示黄金相对高估或原油低估。历史上，比率向均值回归时，通常由原油价格反弹主导(如2008年后油价回升)，而非黄金下跌。投资者可结合其他指标(如美元指数、通胀预期)调整组合，例如在高比率时增持原油或能源股，减持黄金。", "reviewId": "21221247_80SSieqrV", "commentId": "21221247_80SSieqrV_c21221247_80STaxKE2", "userVid": 21221247, "createTime": 1749838601, "likesCount": 7, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 21221247, "name": "lll", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/UIG6ibh0IfaBW1QjDIfUKibsJyLBoqec6nYwqlLvko118IMFcW4BS5kMp8Z8EZJ5V7zlBAFHO1xH6qEH1Orm1UcA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "lll", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "LLL", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-500", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 500}}}, {"content": "蹭个热点，中东伊朗以色列冲突，\n\n截至2025年6月14日，纽约黄金期货价格为3,452.7美元/盎司，布伦特原油期货价格为62.96美元/桶，按此计算的金油比约为54.84;若以WTI原油期货价格64.98美元/桶计算，比率约为53.13。这一数值显著高于历史均值(10-25)，接近2024年6月创下的30.8高位，反映出当前市场对经济不确定性的担忧和避险需求的激增", "reviewId": "21221247_80SSieqrV", "commentId": "21221247_80SSieqrV_c21221247_80SSZtH0p", "userVid": 21221247, "createTime": 1749838437, "likesCount": 5, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 21221247, "name": "